    "talks": [
        {
            "id": "7665006",
            "objective": "Go to the Frostmoon Enclave $HIDDEN",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7665001",
            "objective": "Go to the Frostmoon Enclave",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "766500101",
                    "speaker": "Longplume Ibis",
                    "text": "~♪"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500102",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "...Yes, I'm sure you have very many friends indeed, but that's not the issue. Even if you summoned every ibis on Hiisi Island, I still don't think you'd be able to move the Moon Mirror."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500103",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "And even if you managed it, the Lunar Semblance within would still—"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500104",
                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                    "text": "!!!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500105",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "...Dig it out? Hmm. You could, but moving the Mirror would still pose a challenge, even for you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500106",
                    "speaker": "Longplume Ibis",
                    "text": "♪"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500107",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "Huh? You really can summon every ibis on the island, if that's what it takes...?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500108",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "...And you, on the other hand, think this plan is a joke, even if the Ibis gets its entire family involved...?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500109",
                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                    "text": "!!!"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500110",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Wow, things are really kicking off over here... Looks like we've got a Weasel Thief in a heated argument with a bird...",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "766500111",
                            "text": "Planning a joint heist?",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "766500113",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "We're \"plotting and scheming,\" to be precise. I'm told we have to \"get all our ducks in a row\" before moving forward on this job."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500114",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "But my co-conspirators disagree quite strongly on the best approach, and they're not exactly being diplomatic about it. Choice words have been spoken..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500115",
                                    "speaker": "Longplume Ibis",
                                    "text": "♪"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500116",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "Alright, alright, I believe you — I'm sure you do have friends in high places. Although, where did you learn to speak like that..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500117",
                                    "speaker": "Longplume Ibis",
                                    "text": "♪"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500118",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "...From a short girl with a metal arm and a hat?"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500119",
                                    "speaker": "Longplume Ibis",
                                    "text": "♪"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500120",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "...Oh, of course you can keep talking like that, so long as you enjoy it. But... be sensible around her, okay? Don't copy everything she does."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500121",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "#I'm going to have a little chat with {NICKNAME} and Paimon now, so be good and pipe down a little."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500122",
                                    "speaker": "Longplume Ibis",
                                    "text": "♪"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500123",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Wow, it really did quiet down. Being able to understand animal-speak is so cool! Paimon wishes she had that ability..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500124",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "...Trust me, Paimon. You would not enjoy it very much at all.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "766500125",
                                            "text": "That sounded ominous...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500127",
                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                    "text": "Ah, don't misunderstand. Nothing terrible would happen, and it doesn't drive you insane or anything like that..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500128",
                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                    "text": "...Although, that being said, I do sometimes find it quite overwhelming..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500129",
                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                    "text": "I was overjoyed when I first discovered that I could understand animal-speech, but I quickly realized that it came with a downside..."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500130",
                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                    "text": "This ability is always active, and I cannot control it."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500131",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Oh... Yeah, that would be a problem. And if you can't control it, that means...",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "766500132",
                                                            "text": "From the forest to the waterfront...",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "766500134",
                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                    "text": "...Exactly. People say that listening to the birdsong deep in the woods gives them a profound sense of peace and quiet that lifts their spirits."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "766500135",
                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                    "text": "But no matter where I go, I... can never find peace and quiet."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "766500136",
                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                    "text": "When I stand in the forest, I hear the chatter of the wildcats, the rabbits, the rimehorn deer, the chic badgers, and the longplume ibis..."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "766500137",
                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                    "text": "They argue loudly about who's to blame for damaging whose roost, or which part of the woods the best twigs come from...",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "766500138",
                                                                            "text": "So your ears can never get any rest.",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766500140",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "A—Alright... Guess talking to animals isn't all it's cracked up to be."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766500141",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                                                    "text": "Waking up to the sound of birds chirping is pretty nice, but... Replace that chirping with bickering, and suddenly it doesn't seem so appealing.",
                                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "766500142",
                                                                                            "text": "We both know it takes more than a little chirping to wake you up.",
                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "766500144",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                                    "text": "As for me... I've lived with it so long that I'm used to it now. In fact, it would probably be quite an adjustment if I woke up one day and couldn't hear the finches discussing which cup in which house makes for the best bath."
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "766500145",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                                                                                                    "text": "♪"
                                                                                                },
                                                                                                {
                                                                                                    "id": "766500146",
                                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                                    "text": "#...Yes, plotting and scheming, thank you for reminding me — I got a little sidetracked. Although, now that {NICKNAME}'s here, we might just have the solution to our problem.",
                                                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "766500147",
                                                                                                            "text": "I got friends in high places too...",
                                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "766500149",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                                                    "text": "No, no, just you will suffice."
                                                                                                                },
                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                    "id": "766500150",
                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                                                    "text": "This job involves breaking into a storage room by undoing the seal created with the Moon Mirror by a previous Moonchanter. But for someone of your talents, I'm sure it will be a simple task.",
                                                                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                                            "id": "766500151",
                                                                                                                            "text": "Created by a previous Moonchanter?",
                                                                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                                                                {
                                                                                                                                    "id": "766500153",
                                                                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                                                                    "text": "Don't worry, I'm sure you'll be fine. Come, let's go."
                                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                                            ]
                                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                                            "id": "766500152",
                                                                                                                            "text": "I'm going to need some on-the-job training!"
                                                                                                                        }
                                                                                                                    ]
                                                                                                                }
                                                                                                            ]
                                                                                                        },
                                                                                                        {
                                                                                                            "id": "766500148",
                                                                                                            "text": "I just need a little time to get a crew together."
                                                                                                        }
                                                                                                    ]
                                                                                                }
                                                                                            ]
                                                                                        },
                                                                                        {
                                                                                            "id": "766500143",
                                                                                            "text": "How many times have I had to shake you awake?"
                                                                                        }
                                                                                    ]
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "766500139",
                                                                            "text": "It's non-stop chatter, wherever you go..."
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "766500133",
                                                            "text": "Wherever there are animals around..."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "766500126",
                                            "text": "I have chills running down my spine..."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "766500112",
                            "text": "Are they arguing over how to split the loot?"
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7665002",
            "objective": "Go to the Moon Mirror",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "766500201",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "Here we are. What you see now is the Moon Mirror, within which the Lunar Semblance is sealed."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500202",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Must be a pretty precious statue if they went to all this effort to seal it away... Will there be some traps inside? Y'know, the kind that send arrows flying out if you step in the wrong place?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "766500203",
                            "text": "I'm ready either way.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "766500205",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "Do not worry. This little one did some scouting for me ahead of time. The seal does not contain any such fatal traps."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500206",
                                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                                    "text": "♪"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500207",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Oh, nice! That's good to know. And yeah, that sounds like a job for a weasel thief.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "766500208",
                                            "text": "But from the looks of it...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500210",
                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                    "text": "Haha. That's true. Each time I ask it for help, I have to pay it one Mora more the next time we meet."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500211",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Heh, what a thieving little weasel! ...Oh wait, that tracks."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500212",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Hmm, but considering that it's helping you keep watch on the Lunar Semblance, it might need a name change."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500213",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "How about... \"Weasel Guardian\"!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500214",
                                                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                                                    "text": "!!!"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500215",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Hehe, can't catch Paimon, Paimon can fly! Nyeehh~"
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500216",
                                                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                                                    "text": "!!!",
                                                    "choices": [
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "766500217",
                                                            "text": "Hey, hey, don't climb onto me...",
                                                            "response": [
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "766500219",
                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                    "text": "Come on, be nice to our guests."
                                                                },
                                                                {
                                                                    "id": "766500220",
                                                                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                                                                    "text": "...",
                                                                    "choices": [
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "766500221",
                                                                            "text": "So, how do I help?",
                                                                            "response": [
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766500223",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                    "text": "To retrieve the Lunar Semblance, we need to activate pairs of mechanisms in two different locations. So, it's a two-person job."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766500224",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                    "text": "If you head over there and take the mechanism on that side, I'll take this side."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766500225",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Player",
                                                                                    "text": "But how do we make sure we activate them simultaneously?"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766500226",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                    "text": "That won't be a problem. I have eyes in the sky."
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766500227",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Longplume Ibis",
                                                                                    "text": "♪"
                                                                                },
                                                                                {
                                                                                    "id": "766500228",
                                                                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                                                                    "text": "It will keep me updated on where you are and which mechanism is in front of you. Don't worry, all you have to do is follow my instructions."
                                                                                }
                                                                            ]
                                                                        },
                                                                        {
                                                                            "id": "766500222",
                                                                            "text": "How will we get this mechanism open?"
                                                                        }
                                                                    ]
                                                                }
                                                            ]
                                                        },
                                                        {
                                                            "id": "766500218",
                                                            "text": "Not the hair! Not the hair..."
                                                        }
                                                    ]
                                                }
                                            ]
                                        },
                                        {
                                            "id": "766500209",
                                            "text": "This weasel thief doesn't work for free..."
                                        }
                                    ]
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "766500204",
                            "text": "I'm used to this sort of thing."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7665003",
            "objective": "Operate the device(s) within the Moon Mirror",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "766500301",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Wow, what a huuuge statue... Yeah, no amount of birds or weasels is shifting that."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500302",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "They probably couldn't even get past the mirror... So Lauma, just how valuable is this statue, anyway?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500303",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "In terms of Mora? Not much, I suspect."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500304",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "It's crudely fashioned, and the kind of stone it's carved from is found everywhere around these parts..."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500305",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "But to the Moonchanter of that era, and to the Frostmoon Scions of today, it is a priceless treasure."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500306",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "If nothing else, I now have concrete proof of its existence. That's enough to confirm the reliability of several documents on the topic."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500307",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "To me, that makes this a very successful trip."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500308",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "#Thank you for your help, {NICKNAME}. I knew I had judged you correctly — the Moon Mirror posed no obstacle to you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500309",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "And our little friend here was very impressed with your mechanism-operating skills."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500310",
                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                    "text": "♪"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500311",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "What is it saying, Lauma?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500312",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "#It says that {NICKNAME} is the best treasure-hunter it's ever seen. It wishes it could join {M#him}{F#her} on a quest to unlock all the treasure chests in the world.",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "766500313",
                            "text": "Gee, that makes me sound like a thief...",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "766500315",
                                    "speaker": "Weasel Thief",
                                    "text": "♪"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500316",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "\"From now on, I'll call on you if I ever find a treasure chest I can't crack!\""
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500317",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "Uh... Okay, bye then... Didn't even give us a choice in the matter!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500318",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "Don't worry, it won't come knocking on your window every day with a Mora coin in its jaws, trying to drag you off on a treasure hunt..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500319",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "And it certainly won't be visiting your room in the dead of night, moaning about locks it can't pick..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500320",
                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                    "text": "#Uh oh, we'd better make sure to lock all our doors and windows before we go to sleep tonight, {NICKNAME}!"
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500321",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "Relax. That weasel's only a child, it means no harm. It's just... more talkative than most."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500322",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "Alright, let's head back. It's almost time for dinner."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500323",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "Oh, and we still need to figure out how to get this statue back to our library..."
                                },
                                {
                                    "id": "766500324",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "...It seems like I'll need a little help from my friends after all."
                                }
                            ]
                        },
                        {
                            "id": "766500314",
                            "text": "It's true that I've opened a ton of chests, though..."
                        }
                    ]
                }
            ]
        },
        {
            "id": "7665004",
            "objective": "Talk to Lauma",
            "dialogues": []
        },
        {
            "id": "7665005",
            "objective": "Return to the Frostmoon Enclave",
            "dialogues": [
                {
                    "id": "766500401",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "Just here will do."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500402",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Huh. That all went down without much fanfare. Paimon was expecting something exciting to happen once we put it down."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500403",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "Hehe, well, it's just a plain old statue — a historical relic. It doesn't hold any kind of mystical power."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500404",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "The real value lies in the stories behind it... My job is to dig those stories up wherever they might be hiding, verify them, and then share them with the people."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500405",
                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                    "text": "Cool! Well, it's a good thing we got it back here in one piece."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500406",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "Indeed, and you two have my thanks for that. Please, take these fruits and quench your thirst — I had the animals gather them in the woods."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500407",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "And after that... Forgive me, but I have another request to make of you."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500408",
                    "speaker": "Player",
                    "text": "Sure. What do you need?"
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500409",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "I apologize if this is presumptuous of me, but I've seen how well-connected you are, and I've heard of your many travels into secret and forgotten places."
                },
                {
                    "id": "766500410",
                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                    "text": "On your future travels, if you ever come across any texts about the Frostmoon Scions, could I borrow them and make a copy with which to enrich our library?",
                    "choices": [
                        {
                            "id": "766500411",
                            "text": "Of course.",
                            "response": [
                                {
                                    "id": "766500413",
                                    "speaker": "Lauma",
                                    "text": "You have my sincere gratitude, on behalf of the Frostmoon Scions.",
                                    "choices": [
                                        {
                                            "id": "766500414",
                                            "text": "I'm gonna get back to that fruit now...",
                                            "response": [
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500416",
                                                    "speaker": "Paimon",
                                                    "text": "Hoo-boy, that was some seriously tasty fruit! Sooo much better than Paimon's used to."
                                                },
                                                {
                                                    "id": "766500417",
